      "role": "user",
      "content": "compassion doesnt change the fact that the spark is gone. it's not just a \"tough time,\" it’s a fundamental loss of self. i look at my old work and it's like a stranger wrote it. if i keep going, i'm just going to spend the next twenty years making garbage and watching my reputation rot. i'd rather stop now while i'm still \"something\" than live to see myself become a joke.",
